      "id": "claim_13d83ca21d1148bdb4f6d7acb0f8b8d1",
      "statement": "Conventions at a glance: TypeScript strict no any, Zod schemas with z.infer over hand-rolled interfaces, Vietnamese user copy with VND integer display; money is stored exact as numeric(15, 0) for ledger and trip money columns, while the remaining scale-2 numerics hold fractional quantities and per-liter prices (fuel norms L/100km, liters, fuel allowances, unit_price) rather than ledger amounts; intermediate math goes through round2dp()/computeTripTotals() from shared/src/calculations; one driver per trip (single trips.driver_id), append-only ledger, Vietnamese audit messages, casbinAuthz + requireRoles dual-layer RBAC, Tailwind v4 via @tailwindcss/vite (no tailwind.config), no !important, no raw DB IDs in UI text, mobile-first for DRIVER/FORWARDER.",
